  "faq": {
    "programId": "executive-program-in-pmds",
    "points": [
      {
        "title": "Program Pre-Requisites",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "Do I need to have prior Product Management & Data Science experience to enroll in the program?",
            "content": [
              "No, the program is designed to be inclusive of all levels of experience. All topics will be covered from the basics, making it suitable for individuals from any field of work."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What is the minimum system configuration required?",
            "content": [
              "Any latest processor (i3/i5/i7) with 2.0GHz clock speed and RAM 4GB (required), 8GB(recommended)."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Syllabus & Projects Covered",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How many projects can I anticipate working on?",
            "content": [
              "In Executive Program in Product Management & Data Science you will have access to case studies and Capstone Projects to provide a better understanding of the real-world applications of Product Management and Data Science concepts."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What's the difference between case studies & projects?",
            "content": [
              "Case studies are targeted towards concept validation and limited to only a single concept. However, projects are targeted to overall learning and are more of a combination of multiple topics."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What all topics are covered in the Executive Program in Product Management and Data Science?",
            "content": [
              "Download our latest program [brochure & curriculum](#curriculum)."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Time Commitment",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How much time does one need to spend on a regular basis?",
            "content": [
              "Ideally, 30 minutes of preparation time is recommended each day, but students can allocate time according to their own schedules. They can choose to practice, read, or watch videos. Additionally, students must attend live classes on weekends. The schedule for these classes will be shared in advance."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What is the duration of the program?",
            "content": [
              "The duration of the program is 11 months, every term is approximately 4-5 weeks long."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title":  "Why E&ICT, IIT Guwahati ?",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How's the Executive Program in Product Management and Data Science different?",
            "content": [
              "## This program is distinguished by three key elements:",
              "- **Iterative Mastery Approach:** IITG's exclusive Iterative Mastery Approach ensures development through a step-by-step methodology, specifically designed to welcome individuals from diverse backgrounds. Whether you're seeking a lateral move in the industry or looking to broaden your skills, our program is tailored to empower you on your unique learning journey.",
              "- **Versatile Skill Development Model:** IITG's unique framework ensures that every Product Management concept is taught in the context of real-world industry problems. Our program goes beyond theory, emphasizing practical case studies to prepare students for the challenges they'll face in the professional arena.",
              "- **Accredian Career Center:** Aligned with our mission to cultivate the leaders of tomorrow, the Accredian Career Center empowers you to confidently launch your career."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Tell me more about Career Assistance?",
            "content": [
              "Accredian provides career assistance through the Career Launchpad program. Students gain hands-on experience as leaders in their chosen field with rigorous resume and portfolio building sessions. The program also covers creating a strong online presence and developing top-notch interview skills."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What's the refund policy?",
            "content": [
              "Go through our Student Policy [link](/policies/iitg-policy)"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
